  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 36253114368
    m_Localized: Sirius the fox knight defeated the dragon, but the kingdom never
      knew the truth.In battle, Sirius was actually terrified. The dragon opened
      its jaws, and the fox dropped his sword out of fear. His huge tail puffed up,
      and a stray spark ignited his red fur.Panicking, Sirius dashed wildly around
      the cave. Trying to follow the fiery blur with his eyes, the dragon twisted
      his own neck into a knot and snapped it.Sirius put out his tail, stepped out
      to the crowd, and smiled humbly. Cunning and pure luck had won the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 103848517632
    m_Localized: Mage Frost put an army of orcs to flight, and the Academy praised
      his mastery. But Frost knew the embarrassing truth.He didn't summon a blizzard;
      he just had a terrible cold. Surrounded by orcs, the mage wanted to read a
      fireball scroll but sneezed monstrously instead.A powerful wave of freezing
      snow blasted from his nose, turning the battlefield into a rink. The orcs slipped,
      crashed into each other, and rolled down the mountain.Frost wiped his nose
      and accepted the glory. A bad cold is the best defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
